    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>“You have reforged the idea of safety into something portable.”</em></p><p>As an <strong>action</strong>, you can ignite a moving demilitarized zone of hammered light.</p><ul><li>You create a <strong>3 squares-radius</strong> Sanctuary Field centered on you that lasts for <strong>1 minute</strong> and moves with you.</li><li>Allies inside the field have <strong>resistance to all damage</strong>.</li><li>Hostile creatures inside the field have <strong>disadvantage</strong> on attack rolls against creatures other than you.</li><li>When an ally inside the field spends Body dice to heal, they roll each die <strong>twice</strong> and take the higher result.</li><li>If a peaceful objective (surrender, treaty, rescue, extraction, or similar) is completed during the field’s duration or within 1 minute after it ends, your faction gains <strong>+1 Diplomacy OP</strong> and <strong>+1 Soft Power OP</strong> for the next strategic turn.</li></ul><p><em>This is what happens when you strike mercy on the anvil long enough—reality learns manners.</em></p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
